  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the air fryer to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Roll out the flatbread to a thickness of about 1/4 inch.",
    "Brush the flatbread with olive oil and season with salt, black pepper, and sumac.",
    "Air fry the flatbread for 5 minutes, or until crispy and golden brown.",
    "Top the flatbread with parma ham, garlic, and lemon juice.",
    "Sprinkle chopped parsley over the top of the flatbread.",
    "Return the flatbread to the air fryer and cook for an additional 2 minutes, or until the parma ham is crispy.",
    "Remove the flatbread from the air fryer and let cool for a few minutes before slicing and serving."
